# i386 configuration for libknowledge.
# LplKnowledge compiled -ffreestanding into libknowledge.a. Only the READER side
# is listed here: harvesting allocates, parses text and speaks HTTP, and none of
# that belongs in ring 0. What the kernel links can open a baked image, answer a
# bounded query, and nothing else.
#
# Determinism flags identical to libengine: -msse2 -mfpmath=sse -ffp-contract=off
# -fno-math-errno -mstackrealign. Anything linked into the kernel obeys one
# arithmetic contract, not one per library.
ARCH_CXXFLAGS=-msse2 -mfpmath=sse -ffp-contract=off -fno-math-errno -mstackrealign
ARCH_CPPFLAGS=

# LplKnowledge sources compiled into libknowledge.a (paths relative to
# LPLKNOWLEDGE_ROOT).
#
# As with libengine and libassistant, the source list is EXPLICIT and must be kept in
# lock-step with the xmake build. A glob would pull the hosted half into ring 0 the first
# time somebody added a file to harvest/.
#
# knowledge/ and corpus/ only, and the line between them and the rest is the one the whole
# project is drawn along:
#
#   knowledge/  the .lplknow image, its bounded reader, its queries, its provenance
#   corpus/     identity and addressing — URN/CTS, locus, language, baked text
#
#   harvest/    OUT: ingestion. A heap, a text parser and HTTP.
#   mirror/     OUT: offline documentation mirrors. Same reasons.
#   media/      OUT: pulling substance out of video. Same reasons.
#   graph/      GONE, not merely out: every one of its eight headers described something
#               `lpl::history` (gate P13, inside libengine) already implements and gates,
#               or that knowledge/Query.hpp does. See LplKnowledge/graph/FOLDED.md.
#
# Nothing here calls libm, and nothing here needs to: an identifier is a hash, a query is a
# comparison, and a confidence crosses the wire as a raw Q16.16 word that only ever becomes
# arithmetic once it reaches `lpl::history` — which is in libengine, where the Fixed32
# contract already lives.
ARCH_KNOWLEDGE_SRCS=\
knowledge/src/Types.cpp \
knowledge/src/KnowledgePack.cpp \
knowledge/src/Query.cpp \
knowledge/src/FactStore.cpp \
knowledge/src/Provenance.cpp \
knowledge/src/History.cpp \
knowledge/src/Parity.cpp \
corpus/src/Urn.cpp \
corpus/src/Locus.cpp \
corpus/src/Language.cpp \
corpus/src/TextView.cpp \
